msgctxt "208"
msgid "You learned the Essence of Jumping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Great, Kiryu-san! 11/10 on the execution! That turned out\r\n"
"even better than I had imagined!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Can't say I expected much, but I actually learned something.\r\n"
"Thanks for the tip, Mack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Of course, Kiryu-san! Seeing you see what you saw, it felt\r\n"
"like I was learning, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"You know... I think you might be the guy who finally takes\r\n"
"the perfect shot I've been after all these years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "What do you mean, perfect shot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "That's the thing... I dunno what it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"I've touched hearts and minds with my photos, but I've\r\n"
"never been satisfied with my work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"So... I guess the perfect shot would be something that\r\n"
"touches me just like I touched those other people!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Huh. Makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Anyways, I'm off to travel the world! The cliffs of Machu\r\n"
"Picchu! The splendor of Angkor Wat! The natural grandeur of\r\n"
"the Norwegian fjords! Who knows where inspiration'll strike!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Oh, and I won't be leaving you in the dark, either! I'll\r\n"
"shoot you an email if I hear of anything that might lead to a revelation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Sounds good. Later, Mack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Until we meet again, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "(Well that was... something. Time to go.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "You get what you're supposed to do, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"All righty, then! Get your peepers trained on that old lady\r\n"
"and get ready to learn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Okay, I'll give you the rundown all over again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"First things first, you're gonna wanna take a peek at that\r\n"
"sweet old bag of bones on the scooter there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"When you see something interesting, get close and\r\n"
"press <Action:Button_R3@Adventure> to enter first person mode.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"If the \"Look\" message appears in the top right,\r\n"
"inspiration is just a camera flash away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"Then, hit the right buttons at the right time\r\n"
"to take photos of your inspiration!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"If you successfully take all three photos, you will\r\n"
"have the opportunity to prove what you've learned.\r\n"
"Choose the right answer to gain the Revelation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"All righty, then! Get your peepers trained on that old lady\r\n"
"and get ready to learn!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Aw, mannn! You were so close!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Hold up, she's gonna do it again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Try and get the perfect shot this time, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Hey, you there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Oh, yeah! You're perfect, man! That physique, that mystique!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Just perfect! Mm mmm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "...What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Oh, sorry for creeping you out. The name's Mack. I travel\r\n"
"the globe, photographing only the absolute coolest shit the\r\n"
"world has ever seen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "...Right. I'm Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Do you need something? I kinda have places to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "You know what a Revelation is, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "It's... something like an epiphany, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Bingo ringo, my man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Lemme tell you, every single shot I take tries to drag the\r\n"
"pure beauty out of everything. Nature, people, the works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"Now a Revelation? That's basically a moment of mental\r\n"
"clarity that only comes when you see that pure beauty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid ""
"Wanna learn how to learn 'em, Kiryu-san? I promise they'll\r\n"
"come in major handy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"Oh, so you're not a creep. Guess that's what I get for\r\n"
"assuming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"Either way, I'm not much of a photographer. I don't even\r\n"
"own a camera."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "No problemo, big boy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "Anything'll work, even a phone camera!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "You see, it's all about the method, not the tool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"Trust me, Kiryu-san. I got a third eye for talent, and\r\n"
"you've got it oozing outta your pores!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"Uh... Thanks? Anyway, are you sure this'll work with just my\r\n"
"phone camera?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Of course! Just step on over here for a sec."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "Now where's that shot? Hmmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Ah, Kiryu-san! I can feel it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"There you go. Take a peek at that sweet old bag of bones on\r\n"
"the scooter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "Something's gonna go down here, believe you me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid ""
"And when it does, a flash of inspiration's gonna strike you\r\n"
"like a friggin' sledgehammer to the temple!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid ""
"Oh, and don't forget to blog about it afterward! Gotta\r\n"
"spread the love, get those sweet, sweet internet points."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "...I have no idea what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll show you the ropes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid ""
"See? All you gotta do is spill your heart out, press that\r\n"
"big red update button... and voilà!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "See? Not so tough!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "...Yeah, I guess not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid ""
"Now then, Kiryu-san! Keep your eyes tuned on that scooter\r\n"
"and get ready to be inspired!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "(...Is this really gonna work? Guess I'll find out soon enough.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"When you see something interesting, get close and\r\n"
"press <Action:Button_R3@Adventure> to enter first person mode.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"If the \"Look\" message appears in the top right,\r\n"
"inspiration is just a camera flash away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid ""
"Then, hit the right buttons at the right time\r\n"
"to take photos of your inspiration!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid ""
"If you successfully take all three photos, you will\r\n"
"have the opportunity to prove what you've learned.\r\n"
"Choose the right answer to gain the Revelation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "I think so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "Actually, I need to hear it again."
msgstr ""

